---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Our Story | ROEL Home Solutions"
  description="Meet ROEL Home Solutions — an emerging architectural materials brand shaped by quality, design and lasting relationships."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
      <h1>Creating spaces.<br /><em>Defining living.</em></h1>
      <p>Meet ROEL Home Solutions — an emerging architectural materials brand shaped by quality, design and lasting relationships.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container about-lead">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The ROEL identity</span>
      <h2>Spaces<br /><em class="italic">elevated.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>ROEL Home Solutions is an emerging premium brand focused on architectural materials, doors, wall solutions and decorative products for modern spaces.</p>
      <p>We believe that exceptional spaces begin with the right materials, thoughtful design and attention to detail. Our approach brings together aesthetics, functionality and quality to help create environments that reflect individual style and modern living.</p>
      <p>Our carefully selected products are designed to meet the evolving needs of homeowners, architects, interior designers, builders and industry professionals.</p>
      <p>At ROEL, we aim to make architectural and decorative solutions more accessible through quality-driven products, contemporary designs and customer-focused service.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container about-feature-image">
    <img src="/images/wave.webp" alt="Architectural wood surfaces with flowing dimensional detailing" loading="lazy" />
  </div>

  <section class="container" style="padding:90px 0">
    <span class="eyebrow">Building for what comes next</span>
    <div class="intro-block" style="margin-top:25px">
      <h2 class="intro-statement serif">A brand with a <em>long view.</em></h2>
      <p style="line-height:2;color:var(--muted);margin:0">
        Our journey is driven by a long-term vision to grow beyond individual product categories and become a comprehensive architectural materials company. With a commitment to continuous improvement and thoughtful expansion, ROEL is building a brand that brings together materials, design and modern living.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="vision-mission">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--champagne)">01 / Our vision</span>
      <h2>Looking <em class="italic">ahead.</em></h2>
      <p>To establish ROEL as a trusted and recognised name in the architectural materials industry, expanding our presence through innovative products, quality standards and meaningful customer relationships.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--champagne)">02 / Our mission</span>
      <h2>Built on <em class="italic">purpose.</em></h2>
      <p>To deliver thoughtfully selected architectural products that combine design, durability and functionality while creating lasting value for our customers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span>
          <h2>The values behind <em class="italic">ROEL.</em></h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <article class="value-card">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <h3>Quality</h3>
          <p>Prioritising reliable materials and lasting performance.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="value-card">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <h3>Design Excellence</h3>
          <p>Embracing contemporary aesthetics and thoughtful details.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="value-card">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <h3>Trust</h3>
          <p>Building relationships through transparency and commitment.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="value-card">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <h3>Innovation</h3>
          <p>Continuously exploring better materials, products and solutions.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="value-card">
          <span class="num">05</span>
          <h3>Customer Commitment</h3>
          <p>Understanding individual requirements and delivering the right solutions.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-row">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">The next chapter starts here</span>
        <h2>Let's shape your<br /><em class="italic">next space.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Tell us what you are creating. We will help you explore the material direction for your home or project.</p>
        <button class="btn" type="button" data-enquiry="Consultation for a new space">Start a conversation <span class="arrow">↗</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
